+/*
+ * Return the first source position in the current restart-delimited segment.
+ * Unlike poly_work_group_first_true(), this performs a fixed amount of work
+ * for a whole tile. Restart-dense streams therefore cost O(input count), not
+ * O(restart count * workgroup size).
